    "enUS": {
      "description": "Clubtoe friends... dead? Why?\r\n\r\nThis Chogg'Zac fault! Dey say they make ogres strong! They lie!!\r\n\r\nNo more smashing rocks! Tiny creature help Clubtoe smash Chogg'zac stupid heads instead!",
      "summary": "Kill Chogg'Zac in the Sunnyglade cave and collect their heads for Clubtoe.",
      "title": "Twilight No More!",
